      "core_meaning_cn": "把东西牢固黏在一起的材料或动作；由物理黏合引申为巩固关系、联盟、协议或声誉",
      "core_meaning_en": "a binding material or the act of binding firmly, extended figuratively to strengthening relationships or agreements",
      "mental_model_cn": "literal cement = 水泥/粘合剂；verb + relationship/alliance/reputation → “使牢固、巩固”，不是字面“用水泥粘”。",
      "mental_model_en": "Physical binding motivates the figurative solidify/strengthen branch."
